Sigh.

Charisma is not sex appeal. Charisma is leadership ability, persuasive powers,
a smooth line of talk. Why would shopkeepers sell something to you for less
because you are drop dead gorgeous?

Your post assumes ALL wandering monsters are male, and that charisma involves
sex appeal, thus we get higher charisma for women. Nonsense on both counts.

If you insist on realism you will have to give the male characters
slightly higher charisma, to reflect how in the real world so many
people (men and women) find men more persuasive, better leaders etc.
Although how this should affect an orc of unknown gender who you are
trying to charm, I don't see.

